1
00:00:00,416 --> 00:00:03,407
Every morning, you grab your keys and leave for work.

11
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:06,101
You probably think your cat doesn't even notice.

19
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:07,994
But the second that door closes,

25
00:00:08,082 --> 00:00:10,223
she's on the windowsill, watching the street.

32
00:00:10,405 --> 00:00:11,575
Hours go by.

35
00:00:11,643 --> 00:00:13,138
She curls up on your hoodie,

41
00:00:13,396 --> 00:00:15,289
because it still smells like you.

47
00:00:15,541 --> 00:00:17,015
Then she hears your keys...

52
00:00:17,248 --> 00:00:18,446
and runs to the door.

57
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:19,766
But when you walk in,

62
00:00:19,906 --> 00:00:22,114
she acts like she wasn't waiting at all.

